<decision #add-tui-composer-attachments.drag-ingress apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>终端 TUI 如何实现从文件管理器拖入文件？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>用户要求 Composer 支持拖动文件作为附件。</?>
    <decision-text ?>把终端模拟器产生的 bracketed-paste 路径识别为附件；Ctrl+O 与剪贴板图片继续作为等价入口。</?>
    <rationale ?>OpenTUI paste 事件携带 bytes/MIME，而鼠标 drop 仅携带坐标，无法取得 OS file payload。</?>
    <evidence ?>OpenTUI 0.1.96 declarations and current Composer paste/file-picker implementation.</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>
<decision #add-tui-composer-attachments.capability-gate apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>图片附件如何决定能否发给当前模型？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>配置方式对齐 examples/config/llm-provider.json。</?>
    <decision-text ?>以模型 `modalities.input` 为唯一能力真源；未声明 image 时发送前 fail closed 并保留草稿。</?>
    <rationale ?>能力声明比 provider/model 名称推断稳定，且可避免静默丢图。</?>
    <evidence ?>示例配置已有 text/image modalities，而当前 runtime catalog 对所有模型硬编码 image 能力。</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>
<decision #add-tui-composer-attachments.canonical-parts apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>多模态内容应在哪一层采用 provider wire 格式？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>参考 coding agent 的图片素材处理机制进行接口调用。</?>
    <decision-text ?>runtime/conversation 保存 provider-neutral canonical parts，仅在 adapter 边界投影为 Chat `image_url` 或 Responses `input_image`。</?>
    <rationale ?>同一会话可以切换 provider，canonical history 不应绑定单一 vendor schema。</?>
    <evidence ?>现有 Chat 与 Responses builders 已是 provider request projection owners。</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>
<decision #add-tui-composer-attachments.deepseek-vision apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
  durable_candidate = false
}
(
  <question ?>当前是否把 deepseek-v4-flash 接成视觉模型？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>用户认为最近发布的 deepseek-v4-flash 支持识图，并要求联网核实。</?>
    <decision-text ?>接入 V4 Flash 的最新文本/推理/工具能力，但保持 `modalities.input=["text"]`，拒绝图片。</?>
    <rationale ?>截至 2026-08-02，DeepSeek 官方 Responses 文档明确说 image/file input 不支持并会替换为占位文本，Anthropic 兼容接口也将 image 标为 Not Supported。</?>
    <evidence ?>DeepSeek official API docs, Models & Pricing, Responses compatibility, Anthropic compatibility and 2026-07-31 change log.</?>
  )>
)>
<decision #add-tui-composer-attachments.file-materialization apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>普通文件引用由谁读取并如何进入模型上下文？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>Coding AttractorCheck 要求明确 file_reference owner 与路径泄露边界。</?>
    <decision-text ?>file_reference 仅为 local ingress；注入式 AttachmentResolverPort 在 terminal support 中读取/校验并转为 basename+digest 的 text 或 image snapshot，绝对路径不进入 provider。</?>
    <rationale ?>把文件 effect 放在显式 runtime 边界，既保留 UI 的纯逻辑可测性，也避免 provider 与日志泄露本机路径。</?>
    <evidence ?>Coding attractors: cohesive-boundary, explicit-runtime, contract-logic-separation and runtime-binding-pattern.</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>
<decision #add-tui-composer-attachments.rejection-observation apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>不支持的 modality 如何形成可验证证据？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>Coding AttractorCheck 要求 fail-closed 拒绝有结构化可观测事实。</?>
    <decision-text ?>发布脱敏 unsupported_modality semantic diagnostic，并测试 provider network call 为零。</?>
    <rationale ?>UI 错误字符串不足以证明 planner 在 I/O 前拒绝，也不利于运行时排障。</?>
    <evidence ?>Coding attractors: observability-before-speculation and verifiability-first.</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>
<decision #add-tui-composer-attachments.input-intent-boundary apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>如何同时支持附件与普通文件路径文本而不误判？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>用户确认鼠标拖入产生的有效文件路径应弹出简短“附件 / 引用 / 路径文本”三选一，以便精确控制而不采用隐式行为。</?>
    <decision-text ?>bracketed-paste 完整解析为存在文件集合时统一弹三选一：附件按值导入 session asset，引用保留 local file_reference，路径文本原样插入；选择前不读取文件或创建 part。Ctrl+O/@fs 与二进制剪贴板图片保持显式快捷入口。</?>
    <rationale ?>OpenTUI/标准终端通常不能区分拖入产生的路径 bytes 与剪贴板路径 bytes；路径存在性只能识别候选，不能替代用户意图，因此由显式选择消除歧义。</?>
    <evidence ?>OpenTUI PasteMetadata 仅含 mimeType/kind；OpenCode 官方文档以 @ 为文本文件首选入口，本地 OpenCode 源码的存在路径启发式具有同样歧义。</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>
<decision #add-tui-composer-attachments.attachment-asset-storage apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>大附件如何既可恢复又不写入 XNL 日志？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>附件可能很大，不能作为结构化数据直接存到日志。</?>
    <decision-text ?>attachment-derived text/image 内容写入 session-scoped content-addressed asset 文件；history/diagnostic XNL 只保存引用和有界摘要，恢复时校验并物化。</?>
    <rationale ?>把 durable payload 与审计日志分离，可避免 XNL 膨胀，同时保留 session recovery 与 provider replay。</?>
    <evidence ?>当前 StructuredContent 与 semantic_user_input diagnostic 会内联 text/data URL；OpenCode server 也先 materialize attachment 再进入模型输入并设独立大小边界。</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>
<decision #add-tui-composer-attachments.actor-secret-redaction apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>恢复所需 modelConfig 如何避免在 actor.json 泄露 API key？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>用户要求修复 actor 中明文 provider API key。</?>
    <decision-text ?>snapshot 只持久化非敏感 model selection/capability；凭据字段递归脱敏，加载时占位符归一为空，adapter 从当前 provider 配置重新注入。</?>
    <rationale ?>provider 配置才是凭据真源，session snapshot 不应复制 secret；当前 adapter assembly 已支持以 current defaults 填充缺失 override。</?>
    <evidence ?>LocalFileRuntimeSnapshotRepository 当前原样写 modelConfig；ShellRuntimeSupport 会从当前 provider config 合并缺失 apiKey/options。</?>
  )>
  <confidence ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
  <reversibility ?>legacy-unrecorded</?>
)>
